{:paths ["src" "test"]
 ;; Rank 2: the application below every front end. Its sources require only
 ;; kmet.srce.* (rank 1) once the bus lands, plus third-party code; a kmet.agent.*
 ;; namespace may live here (the two-axes rule: the file moves, the namespace
 ;; does not) but the module may never require a module at its own rank or
 ;; above. babashka/process is the version rule's git describe.
 ;;
 ;; The session layer (kmet.agent.session.*, a rank-4 namespace that moved here
 ;; with its files) brings the library edges it uses: libs for fs/edn-store, ai
 ;; for the usage tallies, and the two Maven siblings those need.
 :deps {kmet/libs {:local/root "../libs"}
        kmet/ai {:local/root "../ai"}
        babashka/fs {:mvn/version "0.5.34"}
        babashka/process {:mvn/version "0.6.25"}
        metosin/malli {:mvn/version "0.20.1"}}}
